{"id":"malheur","lemma":"malheur","pos":"noun","rank":1772,"glosses":["mishap, misfortune","sadness, unhappiness"],"ipa":"/ma.lœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a9/Fr-malheur.ogg/Fr-malheur.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"malheurs"},"formAudio":{"malheurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-malheurs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ça porte malheur de dire ça.","en":"It's bad luck to say that.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"door"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Le malheur ne vient jamais seul.","en":"Misery loves company.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"alone"}]},{"text":"Un malheur n’arrive jamais seul.","en":"It never rains but it pours.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"alone"}]},{"text":"À toute chose malheur est bon.","en":"Every cloud has a silver lining.","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"thing"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"good"}]},{"text":"Quel malheur !","en":"What a pity!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/474390","words":[{"g":"which"},null]}]}